id: wrathful-empowering-fury
name: Empowering Fury
order: 2
slot: trait
description: >
  Your burning rage fuels you, driving you to new heights of power.
text: >
  Empowering Fury: Your burning rage fuels you, driving you to new heights of power.
  (1)-[Passive]: While you are below the Injured Health Threshold, increase your Tier of Power Extra Dice by G Dice Categories.
  (2)-[Passive]: Increase your Damage Reduction by 1(T) for each Health Threshold you are below.
  (3)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: When you trigger the second effect of Born for Battle, apply your Surgency twice for the Ki Surge used through this effect.
  (4)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: If you enter the 2nd Grade for this Transformation, gain a stack of Battle Born.

